# NOTE — src/lib/firebase.ts and src/services/telegramService.ts were listed here
# to "protect hardcoded credentials". That never worked: both files were already
# TRACKED, and .gitignore has no effect on a tracked file. The bot token in
# telegramService.ts was committed in b8c9ad4 and stayed public regardless.
# The real protections are: no secret in anything under src/, and
# `npm run check:secrets` (scripts/check-bundle-secrets.mjs) failing the build if
# one reaches dist/. Do not re-add source files here — it hides nothing and
# creates false confidence.
#
# docs/ARCHITECTURE-V3.md was also ignored here. It is the architecture source of
# truth and MUST be committed, so that entry is gone too.
